grab	V;PST;SG;3	grabbed	Something grabbed my arm and I swung without thinking, without looking until Pag yelped and ducked out of reach.
say	V;PST;SG;1	said	"Oh," I said.
lie	V;PST;SG;3	lay	One thing lay motionless.
moan	V;PST;SG;3	moaned	The other moaned and held its head and curled up in a ball.
pant	V;PST;SG;3	panted	"Oh shit," Pag panted.
course	V;PST;SG;3	coursed	Blood coursed unheeded from his nose and splattered down his shirt.
turn	V;PRS;V.PTCP	turning	His cheek was turning blue and yellow.
think	V;PST;SG;1	thought	I thought of something to say.
mean	V;PRS;SG;1	mean	"Oh shit, you — I mean, you never ..."
wipe	V;PST;SG;3	wiped	He wiped his mouth.
smear	V;PST;SG;3	smeared	Blood smeared the back of his hand.
start	V;PST;PL;3	started	"They started it."
mean	V;PRS;SG;1	mean	"Yeah, but you — I mean, look at them!"
moan	V;PRS;V.PTCP	moaning	The moaning thing was crawling away on all fours.
wonder	V;PST;SG;1	wondered	I wondered how long it would be before it found reinforcements.
wonder	V;PST;SG;1	wondered	I wondered if I should kill it before then.
do	V;PST;V.PTCP	done	"You'da never done that before," Pag said.
mean	V;PST;SG;3	meant	Before the operation, he meant.
feel	V;NFIN	feel	I actually did feel something then — faint, distant, but unmistakable.
feel	V;PST;SG;1	felt	I felt angry.
start	V;PST;PL;3	started	"They started —"
back	V;PST;SG;3	backed	Pag backed away, eyes wide.
do	V;PRS;V.PTCP	doing	"What are you doing?
put	V;IMP;2	Put	Put that down!"
raise	V;PST;V.PTCP	raised	I'd raised my fists.
remember	V;NFIN	remember	I didn't remember doing that.
unclench	V;PST;SG;1	unclenched	I unclenched them.
take	V;PST;SG;3	took	It took a while.
have	V;PST;SG;1	had	I had to look at my hands very hard for a long, long time.
