think	V;PRS;SG;1	think	"I think you did die," said my best and only friend.
think	V;PRS;SG;1	think	"I think Siri died, they scooped him out and threw him away and you're some whole other kid that just, just grew back out of what was left.
do	V;PRS;V.PTCP	doing	Jenna was in the tub, and I was doing the Times crossword, listening to the clang of the radiators and the swish of the taxis on the slush outside, when my coffee-scented reverie was broken by a loud squawk from the bathroom, and a splash, and a flesh-upon-cold-tile sort of thump.
go	V;IMP;2	Go	“Go away!
shoo	V;IMP;2	Shoo	Shoo!
get	V;IMP;2	Get	Get out of my bathroom!”
throw	V;PST;SG;1	threw	I threw down my pen and dashed down the hall.
pick	V;PRS;V.PTCP	picking	Jenna was picking herself up off the floor of the bathroom.
chase	V;PRS;V.PTCP	chasing	In the bathtub, a bar of soap was gaily chasing a nylon scrubby thing around the surface of the water.
say	V;PST;SG;3	said	“Damned pixies!” Jenna said, smacking the bathtub’s drain lever.
come	V;PST;SG;3	came	A piteous squeak came from the scrubby thing as the water began to swirl down the drain.
