say	V;NFIN	say	Although I will say that a pixie hiding in the sink among the dirty soup bowls makes doing the dishes an adventure.
get	V;PST;V.PTCP	got	You’ve got to do something about —
know	V;PRS;SG;1	know	yes, I know —
