get	V;PST;V.PTCP	gotten	He had gotten his hair cut, trimmed his nails, washed his neck and behind his ears.
choose	V;PST;V.PTCP	chosen	The outfit he had chosen, khaki pants and a blue button-down shirt -- no tie -- lay neatly folded on the bed.
stand	V;PST;SG;3	stood	He stood before Rachel in his plain white underwear and white socks, gazing at her as if she were a mirror.
say	V;PST;SG;3	said	"No," she said.
stand	V;PST;SG;3	stood	It was the first time she had been to his apartment, and she stood square in the center of his bedroom, her arms folded against her body as if she was afraid to sit down, to touch something.
like	V;NFIN	like	"My father will like you," she said.
like	V;PRS;SG;3	likes	"But he likes everyone.
