talk	V;PST;V.PTCP	talked	"But you haven't talked about her to me."
snort	V;PST;SG;3	snorted	Rachel snorted.
sigh	V;PST;SG;3	sighed	Then she sighed in a way that seemed to suggest she was regretting her decision to take him home.
guess	V;PST;SG;3	guessed	"You're ashamed of me," he guessed, and Rachel kissed him and smiled and didn't say anything.
