rise	V;PST;SG;3	rose	She was nineteen, two years younger than Carroll; she was a student at Jellicoh College and every weekday she rose at seven and biked four miles into town, and then back again on her bike, four miles uphill to the farm.
meet	V;PST;SG;3	met	Carroll met Rachel in the Jellicoh College library, where he had a part-time job.
