whisper	V;NFIN	whisper	“Can’t it whisper?”
know	V;NFIN	know	“Perhaps I don’t know the answers anyway?” said the voice.
think	V;PST;V.PTCP	thought	“Have you thought of that?”
want	V;NFIN	want	“Anyway, I don’t want it in exams.
want	V;PRS;SG;1	want	I just want it to go.
