study	V;PRS;SG;1	study	"I study history in school," I said.
teach	V;PST;PL;3	taught	Anneal and Kumar taught it.
know	V;NFIN	know	"Do you know the history of this world?"
take	V;PST;SG;3	took	It took my tired head a long time to sort that out.
say	V;PST;SG;1	said	"Yes," I said.
come	V;PRS;PL;3	come	People from Earth come here to live.
