forget	V;PRS;1;PL	forget	We forget we are from Earth.
find	V;PRS;SG;3	finds	Then Earth finds us again."
have	V;PRS;PL;3	have	"Some people have stories about coming from the Earth," Veronique said.
collect	V;PRS;V.PTCP	collecting	"My father is collecting those stories from different peoples.
have	V;NFIN	have	The clans didn't have any stories about coming from Earth.
say	V;PST;1;PL	said	We said the first people came out of the sun.
seem	V;PST;SG;3	seemed	This somehow seemed embarrassing.
understand	V;NFIN	understand	I didn't understand what kind of student she was.
ask	V;PST;SG;1	asked	"Are you here for stories?" I asked.
say	V;PST;SG;3	said	"No," she said.
come	V;PST;1;PL	came	We just came to visit."
understand	V;NFIN	understand	I didn't understand what she'd said except that they were visiting.
